  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multi-Sector Assistance to Populations Affected by the Syria Crisis</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project&#x2019;s overall objective is to contribute to the delivery of targeted lifesaving WASH assistance to the most vulnerable persons among the affected population in NWS. IOM and IPs will be providing emergency WASH assistance and life-saving protection service to Earthquake (EQ) affected people in NWS for in both camps and/or collective centers, based on needs.</narrative>
  </description>
